---
// Staged Hermes Desktop mockup. Synthetic agents, sessions and data only.
---

<div
  class="dk"
  role="img"
  aria-label="Illustrative Hermes Desktop mockup connected to the klanker agent. The sidebar lists sessions. In the open session you ask why the Acme build is red; klanker answers that one test fails on a date format, shows a two-line fix, and says the pull request is open with the build green."
>
  <div class="dk-bar" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i><span>Hermes · klanker</span></div>
  <div class="dk-body" aria-hidden="true">
    <div class="dk-side">
      <span class="dk-k">Sessions</span>
      <span class="dk-s on">Acme build is red</span>
      <span class="dk-s">Landing page refresh</span>
      <span class="dk-s">Weekly backup check</span>
    </div>
    <div class="dk-main">
      <div class="dk-msg you"><p>why is the acme build red?</p></div>
      <div class="dk-msg">
        <p class="dk-who">klanker</p>
        <p>One test fails on a date format. The fixture assumes UTC. Fix:</p>
        <pre><span class="k">- tz: local</span>
<span class="s">+ tz: UTC</span></pre>
        <p>PR <b>#42</b> is open, build green.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="dk-input">Message klanker…</div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
